<title>FINLAND: MERITA UNIT TO LAUNCH BOND PROGRAMME.</title>
<headline>MERITA UNIT TO LAUNCH BOND PROGRAMME.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suomen Teollisuuspankki Oy, a unit of banking group Merita Oy, said in a statement on Thursday it would launch a bond programme with a nominal value of at most 1.5 billion markka.</p>
<p>The maturity of the bonds to be launched would be at least one year. The first bonds, due for launch on August 7, will be a 150 million markka 3.85 percent fixed-coupon three-year bond and a 200 million markka 4.55-percent fixed-coupon five-year bond, it said.</p>
</text>
